<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Telstra sees sale bill passed by early 1997.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Telstra sees sale bill passed by early 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telstra Corp chief executive Frank Blount said on Thursday he expected the national parliament's upper house to pass legislation for the one third sale of the telecoms group in about three months.</p>
<p>&quot;I suspect it will come to a vote (in the Senate) in the next couple of weeks. I think it's going to be close. If it's defeated, I'm almost certain it will come back up in three months...I'm betting it will get through in one of the two (voting rounds),&quot; Blount told a business breakfast.</p>
</text>
